# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Every MCP implementation ships a Playwright test.** Each role that gains an MCP surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises its MCP surface (a server role's authenticated endpoint, a client role's configured-server list). No MCP role is considered implemented until its Playwright test is present and green."
msgstr "**Hver MCP implementasjon sender en Playwright test.** Hver rolle som får en MCP-overflate må legge til en matchende Playwright-spesifikasjon under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` som utøver sin MCP-overflate (en serverrollens autentiserte endepunkt, en klientrolles konfigurerte serverliste). Ingen MCP-rolle anses implementert før Playwright-testen er tilstede og grønn."

