# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in ``svc-swarm-node`` resolves ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**Modevalgutløser:** Medlemskap i ``svc-swarm-node`` Løsninger ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` for alle web-app rolle på den verten."

