# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "At boot, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` runs from ``init.groovy.d`` and mints an API token named ``infinito-mcp`` for the administrator account, writing the plain value to ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``. ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` then reads that value out of the container, persists it through ``sys-token-store``, and hard-fails the deploy when the controller rejects it. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` picks the token up from the store and the client roles build the header via the ``mcp_authorization`` filter."
msgstr "Ved boot, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` løper fra ``init.groovy.d`` og minterer en API token navngitt ``infinito-mcp`` for administratorkontoen, skriver den rene verdien til ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``.. ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` så leser den verdien ut av beholderen, fortsetter den gjennom ``sys-token-store``, og hard-feiler utplasseringen når kontrolleren avviser det. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` plukker token opp fra butikken og klientrollene bygge headeren via ``mcp_authorization`` Filtrer."

