# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Best-effort: the puppeteer browser is not downloaded here (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) so ``install-lint`` stays sandbox-safe. mmdc only needs a browser to RENDER, which ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` provisions on demand (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) right before it renders. That browser ships as a zip, so ``unzip`` is ensured here (puppeteer's extractor needs it, else it leaves an empty version dir and mmdc reports the browser missing). A failed install warns instead of aborting ``install-lint``, so sandboxes without npm/browser access still get the rest of the lint toolchain."
msgstr "Beste resultat: duckeer nettleseren lastes ikke ned her (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) så ``install-lint`` Forbli sandkasse-sikker. mmdc trenger bare en nettleser til RENDER, som ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` bestemmelser om etterspørsel (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) Rett før det gjør det. Den nettleseren skip som en zip, så ``unzip`` er sikret her (Duckeer's Extractor trenger det, ellers etterlater det en tom versjonsmappe og mmdc rapporterer nettleseren mangler). En feilaktig installasjon advarer i stedet for å avbryte ``install-lint``, så sandkasser uten npm/browser tilgang fortsatt få resten av lint verktøychain."

