# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Passing ``inventory_groups`` (the ``groups`` magic variable) drops the roles no host in the inventory carries, so they never enter the loop at all. That list is identical on every host, which is the whole point: 8aea5a9b35 measured that a per-host condition above the loop makes ansible insert blocks in host order rather than loop order, after which svc-storage-nfs-client mounted an export svc-storage-nfs-server had not deployed yet. Narrowing to a single host stays in the body's ``when``, never here."
msgstr "Passerer ``inventory_groups`` (den ``groups`` magisk variabel) dråper roller ingen vert i lageret bærer, så de aldri komme inn i sløyfen i det hele tatt. Listen er identisk på hver vert, som er hele punktet: 8aea5a9b35 målt at en per-vert tilstand over sløyfen gjør anstable innleggsblokker i verts rekkefølge i stedet for sløyfe rekkefølge, deretter svc-storage-nfs-client montert en eksport svc-storage-nfs-server hadde ikke blitt utplassert ennå. Spenning til en enkelt vert forblir i kroppens ``when``, Aldri her."

