# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Pure function — reads role metadata via cached YAML helpers and emits ``PlanEntry`` tuples; no filesystem side effects. The include set per round is resolved by the ``CombinedResolver`` (see ``.legacy_resolver``): each role contributes its own pulled-in providers and the include is the union. A service-key is therefore pulled in as soon as ANY role in the round-aware closure says it should be (literal ``True`` OR the ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja form, both accepted by ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); if EVERY role marks it ``False`` it stays out of the include."
msgstr "Ren funksjon — leser rolle metadata via cachede YAML-hjelpere og avgir ``PlanEntry`` tuples; ingen bivirkninger. Inkludert sett per runde løses av ``CombinedResolver`` (se ``.legacy_resolver``): Hver rolle bidrar til sine egne trukket inn-leverandører og inkluderer forening. En tjenestenøkkel trekkes derfor inn så snart som noen rolle i rund-vare lukningen sier det skal være (bokstavelig ``True`` Eller ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja form, begge akseptert av ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``)Hvis alle roller markerer det ``False`` Det forblir utenfor inkludert."

