msgid "The PR-scope short-circuits in [scope.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/pr/scope.sh) (documentation-only, agent-only) still apply at the entry layer. They skip the orchestrator entirely and are independent of the diff-driven whitelist resolution above."
msgstr "PR-scope kortslutninger i [scope.sh](../../../../scripts/meta/resolve/pr/scope.sh) (kun dokumentasjon, kun agent) Fortsatt på innløpslaget. De hopper helt over orkesteret og er uavhengige av den diff-drevet whitelist-oppløsningen ovenfor."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright ``biber`` persona is blocked permanently. ``meta/services.yml`` restricts ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` to the ``web-app-baserow`` administrator RBAC group, so a non-admin identity is rejected by the oauth2-proxy before Baserow renders, and no deploy step provisions a Baserow account for that user."
msgstr "Playwright ``biber`` Persona blokkeres permanent. ``meta/services.yml`` Begrensninger ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` til ``web-app-baserow`` administrator RBAC-gruppen, så en ikke-admin-identitet blir avvist av oaut2-proxy før Baserow gjør, og ingen utplasseringstrinn bestemmelser a Baserow konto for den brukeren."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Playwright `biber` persona is blocked permanently. `meta/services.yml` restricts `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` to the `web-app-baserow` administrator RBAC group, so a non-admin identity is rejected by the oauth2-proxy before Baserow renders, and no deploy step provisions a Baserow account for that user."
