# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` persona logs in through OIDC without trouble; what it cannot do is log out. Decidim’s sign-out is a ``data-method`` link inside the account dropdown, so the role’s own tests navigate to ``/users/sign_out`` directly rather than clicking a button the shared helper could find."
msgstr "Den ``biber`` Persona logger inn gjennom OIDC uten problemer; det det ikke kan gjøre er å logge ut. Decidims utmelding er et ``data-method`` link i kontoens nedtrekk, så rollens egne tester navigere til ``/users/sign_out`` direkte i stedet for å klikke på en knapp som delte hjelperen kunne finne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``context_agent`` and ``contextagentmcp`` services in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` context, read-only with every capability dropped, and it is the only MCP endpoint clients are given."
msgstr "Den ``context_agent`` og ``contextagentmcp`` tjenester i ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` kontekst, lesebeskyttet med alle kapasitetsfall, og det er de eneste MCP-endpoint klienter er gitt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The ``dashboard`` service in ``meta/services.yml`` is only a consumer tile pointing at MIG’s canonical domain; it does not host MIG. The role’s contract is fully carried by the reachability, canonical-domain and content-type scenarios in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, plus the guest persona. The path back to the generic personas is an authenticated MIG surface, which upstream does not have."
msgstr "Den ``dashboard`` service i ``meta/services.yml`` Det er bare en forbrukerbit som peker på MIGkanonisk domene; det ikke vert MIG. Rollens kontrakt utføres fullt ut av rekkevidde, kanonisk dominans og innholdstype scenarier i ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, Pluss gjestepersona. Veien tilbake til den generiske personen er en autentisert MIG Overflate, som oppstrøms har ikke."

