# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The oauth2 ACL in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) blacklists only `/login`, and `sys-svc-proxy` renders a blacklist as *expose everything by default, then protect the listed paths*. The helper lands on `/`, which is public, so the proxy never intercepts it and the Keycloak round trip never starts."
msgstr "Oauth2 ACL i [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) bare svartlister `/login`, og `sys-svc-proxy` En svartliste som *utsette alt som standard, og deretter beskytte de listede stiene*Hjelperen lander på `/`, som er offentlig, så proxyen aldri oppfanger det og Keycloak Rundturen starter aldri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The oauth2 ACL in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ blacklists only ``/login``, and ``sys-svc-proxy`` renders a blacklist as *expose everything by default, then protect the listed paths*. The helper lands on ``/``, which is public, so the proxy never intercepts it and the Keycloak round trip never starts."
msgstr "Oauth2 ACL i ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ blacklists only ``/login``, and ``sys-svc-proxy`` renders a blacklist as *expose everything by default, then protect the listed paths*. The helper lands on ``/``, som er offentlig, så proxyen aldri oppfanger det og Keycloak Rundturen starter aldri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
