# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This makes Home Assistant a natural [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) **MCP server role** and the concrete backend for the isolated-home-assistant scenario in [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md): the agent stays kernel-isolated and reaches the home only through this MCP surface, never through host access. Home Assistant runs natively on `arm64`/Raspberry Pi, so it co-locates with the Pi agent story."
