# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no ``meta/addons/`` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes ``plugins`` and ``client-plugins`` declared in ``meta/volumes.yml`` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image’s prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
msgstr "Denne rollen erklærer ingen addons (Skip no ``meta/addons/`` mappe). Viktigste **Team Edition** administrerer plugin installasjon og aktivering ved kjøring; det er ingen deklarativ per-plugin installere sti i denne rollen. Plugins er operatørstyrt. De navngitte volumene ``plugins`` og ``client-plugins`` Deklarert i ``meta/volumes.yml`` er node-lokale avledede kopier som alle kopiekstrakter for seg selv fra bildets forhåndspakkede pakker; en opplastet pakke varer i filbutikken, ikke i dem. Ingen addon broer noen i-repo tjeneste."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no `meta/addons/` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes `plugins` and `client-plugins` declared in `meta/volumes.yml` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image's prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
