# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YAML / Jinja patterns: ban on direct `yaml.safe_load` calls outside `utils.cache.yaml`, and ban on hardcoded `http://` / `https://` protocol literals adjacent to a `lookup(...)` call."
msgstr "YAML / Jinja mønstre: forbud mot direkte `yaml.safe_load` Ring utenfor `utils.cache.yaml`, Forbud mot hardcoded `http://` / `https://` protokollbokstaver ved siden av en `lookup(...)` Ring."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YAML Files"
msgstr "YAML-filer"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YAML source restricted to the supported block subset."
msgstr "YAML-kilde begrenset til den støttede blokkunderdelen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YAML writes null three ways - ``null``, ``~``, and a key with nothing after it - so a half-typed line empties a topic rather than being ignored."
msgstr "YAML skriver null tre måter - ``null``, ``~``, og en nøkkel med ingenting etter det - så en halv-typet linje tømmer et emne i stedet for å bli ignorert."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS (Your Own URL Shortener) is an open‑source URL shortening solution that enables you to create, track, and manage short links with ease. This deployment leverages Docker to provide a secure and easily scalable environment, ensuring that your YOURLS instance is configured for optimal performance and reliability."
msgstr "TYLS (Din egen URL Shortener) er en åpen kilde URL forkorting løsning som gjør det mulig å opprette, spore og administrere korte lenker med letthet. Denne distribusjonen utnytter Docker for å gi et sikkert og enkelt skalerbart miljø, slik at din YOURLS eksempel er konfigurert for optimal ytelse og pålitelighet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "TYLS har ingen innfødte SSO; admin sesjonen er tatt fra oauth2-proxy identity header ved ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` Persona forblir levende og øver broen til slutt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "TYLS har ingen innfødte SSO; admin sesjonen er tatt fra oauth2-proxy identity header ved `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), som ærer overskriften bare på den portede admin-stien og bare for medlemmer av YOURLS administratorgruppe. Selve porten innrømmer bare den samme RBAC-gruppen ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), så `biber` blir avvist før YOURLS Gir noe: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Deklarasjoner `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, og nektelsen er hevdet eksplisitt av `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. Den `administrator` Persona forblir levende og øver broen til slutt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
