# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "You SHOULD group them by dependency family such as `tests/external/update/` or `tests/external/github/` when more than one test exists."
msgstr "Du grupperer dem etter avhengighet familie som `tests/external/update/` eller `tests/external/github/` Når det finnes mer enn én test."

