# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`entry-push-latest.yml` declares exactly that expression, and it fires only on `push`, where `github.ref_name` is always the pushed branch. [entry-cancel-superseded.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/entry-cancel-superseded.yml) carries no concurrency group of its own — it is the API fallback for that group — but its push job repeats the same predicate as a job `if`, so it never touches `main` either."
msgstr "`entry-push-latest.yml` det uttrykket, og det brann bare på `push`, hvor `github.ref_name` Det er alltid den pressede grenen. [entry-cancel-superseded.yml](../../../../../.github/workflows/entry-cancel-superseded.yml) bærer ingen konovalutagruppe av sin egen - det er den API reserve for den gruppen - men dens push jobb gjentar det samme predikasjonen som en jobb `if`, Så det berører aldri `main` Også."

