# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberds `mod_admin` HTTP UI er den eneste Playwright-testbare overflaten; XMPP klientinnlogging selv kjører over 5222/5269 og må utøves av en XMPP-aware klient utenfor Playwright test sløyfe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberds eneste HTTP-overflate er `ejabberd_web_admin` på `/admin` (se [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Det godkjenner en bare JID mot LDAP over HTTP Basic, så det er ingen Keycloak omdirigere til å følge og ingen utloggingskontroll i appen å klikke; klientautentisering kjører over porter 5222/5269 og holder seg utenfor Playwright sløyfen, som nevnt under Watch Points. `acl.admin` I tillegg lister bare administratoren JID, så webadministratoren nekter alle andre kontoer direkte. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Derfor erklærer `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` og `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; den `guest` Persona og utgangspunktet påstandene om rekkevidde går ubegrenset."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberds ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI er den eneste Playwright-testbare overflaten; XMPP klientinnlogging selv kjører over 5222/5269 og må utøves av en XMPP-aware klient utenfor Playwright test sløyfe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "ejabberds eneste HTTP-overflate er ``ejabberd_web_admin`` på ``/admin`` (se ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` Persona og utgangspunktet påstandene om rekkevidde går ubegrenset."

